</div></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F3.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 3</span>: </span><span id="S4.F3.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Efficiency as rank increases.
<span id="S4.F3.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(Left)</span> PB results.
